🔐 Password Strength Checker & Generator
Built with Python • Created by Rishikesh Borah

A beginner-friendly yet practical cybersecurity utility that helps users analyze password security and generate stronger passwords automatically.
Designed for learning, security awareness, and real-world password hygiene.

Based on your uploaded project file

📌 Overview

Passwords are the first line of defense in cybersecurity.

Weak passwords are one of the biggest causes of:

Account compromise
Credential stuffing attacks
Brute-force attacks
Dictionary attacks
Data leaks

This project solves that problem by combining:

✅ Password Strength Analysis
✅ Secure Password Generation
✅ Security Feedback System
✅ Interactive CLI Experience
✅ Visual Strength Meter

Instead of simply saying strong or weak, the tool explains WHY a password is weak and HOW to improve it.
